feature: method days-in-month
--- code
for (2023, 2, 29), (2024, 2, 29), (2024, 4, 31), (2024, 5, 31) -> ($year, $month, $day is copy) {
    if $day > Date.new(:$year, :$month).days-in-month() {
        $day = 1;
    }
    say "$year-$month: $day";
}
--- expect
