=== num-datetime-truncated-to
from: Time::Crontab 1.0.0 lib/Time/Crontab.pm6:69
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method truncated-to
--- code
for DateTime.new('2024-05-06T10:15:00Z'), DateTime.new('2024-05-06T10:15:42Z') -> $datetime {
    if $datetime.truncated-to('minute') == $datetime {
        say "$datetime on the minute";
    }
    else {
        say "$datetime -> {$datetime.truncated-to('minute')}";
    }
}
